00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.070
that definitely understand how to
properly set up and launch an engine in

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:58.799
the pilot so a pilot script does not
have a proper engine it's a pilot it's

00:01:58.799 --> 00:02:04.710
not a TV show an engine is what is going
