that's absolutely critical and probably
only 20% of writers are doing that so

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.260
80% of writers they might have the most
amazing characters and world and story

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:36.540
but without that engine it's not a TV
show it's just a one-off script I'm

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:39.900
going to put out a bunch of content on
engine so if anyone's interested they

